{clear:right;float:right;margin:4px 0 4px 1em;width:238px}}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output table.messagebox img{max-width:none!important}</style><table class="plainlinks messagebox mbox-style" role="presentation" style="width: 80%"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="position: relative; width: 64px"><div id="commons-template-watermark" style="position: absolute; left: 25px; top: -16px; padding: 0"><span class="noviewer" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Gnome-edit-clear.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Gnome-edit-clear.svg/60px-Gnome-edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" width="45" height="45" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Gnome-edit-clear.svg/120px-Gnome-edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></div><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Watermark_Crown_CA.png/120px-Watermark_Crown_CA.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" width="64" height="76" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Watermark_Crown_CA.png/250px-Watermark_Crown_CA.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="500" data-file-height="594" /></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text">This image contains <strong><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/digital_watermarking" class="extiw" title="w:digital watermarking">digital watermarking</a> or credits in the image itself</strong>. The usage of visible watermarks is <em><a href="/wiki/Commons:Watermarks#Discouraged_watermarks" title="Commons:Watermarks">discouraged</a></em>. If a non-watermarked version of the image is available, <span class="plainlinks"><a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special:Upload&amp;wpDestFile=Papilio_hospiton-Crisalide.png&amp;wpForReUpload=1&amp;wpUploadDescription=%5B%5BCommons%3AWatermarks%23Dealing%20with%20watermarked%20images%7Cwatermark%20removed%5D%5D" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special:Upload&amp;wpDestFile=Papilio_hospiton-Crisalide.png&amp;wpForReUpload=1&amp;wpUploadDescription=%5B%5BCommons%3AWatermarks%23Dealing%20with%20watermarked%20images%7Cwatermark%20removed%5D%5D">please upload it under the same file name</a> and then <a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:Papilio_hospiton-Crisalide.png&amp;action=edit&amp;withJS=MediaWiki:RemoveWatermarktemplate.js" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:Papilio_hospiton-Crisalide.png&amp;action=edit&amp;withJS=MediaWiki:RemoveWatermarktemplate.js">remove this template</a></span>. Ensure that removed information is present in the image description page and replace this template with <a href="/wiki/Template:Metadata_from_image" title="Template:Metadata from image"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">&#123;&#123;Metadata from image&#125;&#125;</span></a> or <a href="/wiki/Template:Attribution_metadata_from_licensed_image" title="Template:Attribution metadata from licensed image"><span style="font-family:monospace,monospace;">&#123;&#123;Attribution metadata from licensed image&#125;&#125;</span></a>.
<p><b>Caution:</b> Before removing a watermark from a copyrighted image, please read <a href="https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Wikilegal/Removal_of_watermarks_from_Commons_images" class="extiw" title="m:Wikilegal/Removal of watermarks from Commons images">the WMF's analysis</a> of the legal ramifications of doing so, as well as Commons' <a href="/wiki/Commons:Watermarks" title="Commons:Watermarks">proposed policy</a> regarding watermarks.
</p>
<small>If the old version is still useful, for example if removing the watermark damages the image significantly, upload the new version under a different title so that both can be used. After uploading the non-watermarked version, replace this template with <style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r588530194">.mw-parser-output .nowrap,.mw-parser-output .nowrap a:before,.mw-parser-output .nowrap .selflink:before{white-space:nowrap}</style><code class="nowrap">&#123;&#123;<a href="/wiki/Template:Superseded" title="Template:Superseded">Superseded</a>&#124;<var style="padding-right: 1px;">new filename</var>&#124;version without watermarks&#125;&#125;</code>.</small><hr /><span style="font-size:small;line-height:1.4" class="plainlinks noprint"><a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/ar" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/ar"><bdi class="language lang-ar" lang="ar">العربية</bdi></a>&#160;<b>∙</b>&#32;<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/be-tarask" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/be-tarask"><bdi class="language lang-be-tarask" lang="be-tarask">беларуская (тарашкевіца)</bdi></a>&#160;<b>∙</b>&#32;<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/bg" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/bg"><bdi class="language lang-bg" lang="bg">български</bdi></a>&#160;<b>∙</b>&#32;<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/ca" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/ca"><bdi class="language lang-ca" lang="ca">català</bdi></a>&#160;<b>∙</b>&#32;<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/cs" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Watermark/cs"><bdi class="language lang-cs" lang="cs">čeština</bdi></a>&#160;<b>∙</b>&#32;<a